    "title": "People in Longview and Tyler Could Save Big Just by Shopping Here More Often - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Longview\nPeople in Longview and Tyler Could Save Big Just by Shopping Here More Often\nBy Tara Holley,\n4 hours ago(KNUE-FM) People in Longview and Tyler could be saving SO much money if they would get in the habit of buying more items at Dollar Stores in Texas. I'll admit, I wasn't much of a dollar store shopper. Honestly, I'm still not. The only reason is that it just hasn't been a habit. Plus, I may have gotten the idea that certain things sold at Dollar Stores don't have the same level of quality as they would at more specialty stores.\n3",
